comment.body:
Catching all exceptions here, including `OperationCanceledException` from `Task.Delay`, will log a warning on normal shutdown. Consider catching `OperationCanceledException` separately to break out without logging or rethrow it.
```suggestion
            }
            catch (OperationCanceledException) when (cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested)
            {
                // Graceful exit on cancellation, no logging needed
            }
```

